    <span class="label">About the coach</span>
    <h1>Iván Koch</h1>
    <p class="about-lede">Endurance coach, in Spanish, English and Portuguese. Started out as the friend who wrote your plan.</p>
    <p>For a long time I thought helping someone wasn't a one-off gesture — it was something you were supposed to be doing. When I coached my first athlete, a friend who wanted a first marathon, I wasn't building a business. I was handing over what I already used on myself.</p>
    <p>That is still the job. Today, after a lot of learning, the certifications and thousands of hours coaching, it's around forty athletes at once.</p>
  </div>
