        <p>Twenty marathons. Three times under 3 hours, the best of them 2h58. The average across those twenty is closer to 3h30.</p>
        <p>The first was 3h23. Then came a lot of 3h30s. There are also afternoons of 4h00, 4h10 and 4h15. Both of those are mine, and the second set is what makes me useful when an athlete&rsquo;s race falls apart halfway through.</p>
      </div>
