    </div>
    <div class="about-row about-row--reverse">
      <div class="about-row-text">
        <p>Three full Ironman finishes, the fastest in 10h06. A 110-kilometre ultra. And all the races nobody asks the time for: the ones I used to test a carbohydrate load, a taper week, or a plan I later hand to someone else.</p>
      </div>
      {% set photoKey = "bike" %}{% include "partials/about-photo.njk" %}
